# The build context is an allowlist: this repository carries a multi-GB pixi environment, a
# 2700-file VCML corpus, and cross-validation reference datasets, none of which belong in an
# image. Exclude everything, then re-include exactly what docker/Dockerfile copies.
*

!pyproject.toml
!pixi.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!src
!docker

# Only the demo models from examples/ — re-include the directory first, then drop the rest of
# it, since a pattern cannot reach inside a directory that was never un-excluded.
!examples
examples/*
!examples/models

# Only the SimulationTask fixtures from tests/ (the image's VCell-path self-test), same pattern.
!tests
tests/*
!tests/fixtures
tests/fixtures/*
!tests/fixtures/simtask

# …minus the noise that lives inside those trees.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
